# Keys whose value in a NON-PROD dotenvx profile (apps/api/.env, .env.dev, .env.staging)
# is allowed to EQUAL the apps/api/.env.prod value — temporarily. An entry waives that
# shared value only: a value that names a prod host, or a LIVE Stripe key, still fails.
# `pnpm test:envs` fails on any other key that matches prod.
# Format: KEY<whitespace>reason. Most entries are a debt: remove the line once the
# vendor has a per-environment credential and the prod value is rotated. A brand value
# (below) is not debt: one public name serves every environment and never diverges.
#
# --- pending per-environment vendor credentials (needs a vendor console) ---
DAYTONA_API_KEY            prod Daytona org; needs a dev org/key, then rotate prod
PIPEDREAM_CLIENT_ID        prod Pipedream project; needs a dev project, then rotate prod
PIPEDREAM_CLIENT_SECRET    prod Pipedream project; needs a dev project, then rotate prod
RESEND_API_KEY             needs a non-prod Resend key, then rotate prod
# --- exposed by the 2026-08-27 SM pull ---
KORTIX_GITHUB_APP_PRIVATE_KEY one GitHub App serves local and prod; needs one App per env
# --- must rotate together with the deployed env's AWS Secrets Manager entry ---
REVENUECAT_WEBHOOK_SECRET  webhook auth header; set a distinct value per env in the RevenueCat dashboard + AWS SM, then rotate prod
# --- one Better Stack telemetry source serves dev and staging too (read-only) ---
BETTERSTACK_CLICKHOUSE_HOST     same Better Stack source; its prod ORIGIN must stay out of non-prod URLs
BETTERSTACK_CLICKHOUSE_USERNAME same Better Stack source user; needs a read-only non-prod user, then rotate
BETTERSTACK_MCP_URL             the one Better Stack MCP endpoint; an origin, not a reach into prod data
# --- brand values: one public name serves every environment, so no per-env value exists ---
CLOUDFLARE_ZONE_NAME            the kortix.com DNS zone; already one zone for all environments
MAILTRAP_FROM_EMAIL             the sender address on the shared mail domain; no per-env mailbox
RESEND_FROM_EMAIL               the sender address on the shared mail domain; no per-env sender
RESEND_MANAGED_DOMAIN           the managed sending domain itself, which prod also serves
KORTIX_PREVIEW_BASE_DOMAIN      p.kortix.com serves previews for every environment, prod included
BETTERSTACK_API_LOG_HOST        the one Better Stack ingestion host; a host name, not a credential
